- e.g. via a replicateUser bug that has since been fixed separately, but\nalso potentially other paths - and this has a real, non-obvious\nconsequence: HibernateUserStore.getUserQuery()'s org-unit join effectively\nbehaves as an INNER JOIN when userOrgUnits=true/orgUnitBoundary is set,\nsilently excluding such users from every org-unit-scoped user search\n(including the assign-user pickers in Tracker/Event Capture), for any\nviewer, including superusers.\n\nConfirmed on a production instance: several real users with zero\nusermembership rows, invisible to the assign-user search despite the\nsearching admin having ALL authority.\n\nAdds users_with_no_organisation_units, a WARNING-severity check listing\naffected users by UID. Remediation is a direct PATCH by UID (confirmed to\nwork independent of the list-query bug, since GET/PATCH by UID never goes\nthrough getUserQuery()) - the check's recommendation text says so\nexplicitly, since affected users won't be discoverable via the normal\norg-unit-scoped search UI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"13763973b0b9bdaa577d2b7fb83274435b0e251e","tree_id":"432bff9f2be66e8dae396897fc7ff6c398742c86","timestamp":"2026-08-17T12:19:56Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users